2026-09-02T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2168) 'Retract RFD66606-1122 (wholebody detector); keep its renderer-first rule and let successor RFDs carry deployment. RFD66606-1122 moves to `abandoned` alongside this document landing.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2168  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2168) 'Retracts: urn:oid:1.3.6.1.4.1.66606.1.1.1122 Superseded by: urn:oid:1.3.6.1.4.1.66606.1.1.{1143,1168,1173}
 # tags: rfd:related
