2026-09-02T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2168) 'What survives
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2168  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2168) '- Renderer-first, RFD66606-1122 rule 1. ANNY is posed and photographed; joints come out of camera arithmetic. RFD66606-1143 uses it as the render leg of its propose loop.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2168  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2168) '- Two-scorer discipline. RFD66606-1143 committed EditScore plus Referee, because a fit that looks right while the joints are wrong passes the first alone.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2168  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2168) '- Renderer as comparison, not detector target. RFD66606-1173's MaskScore (edit-reward corpus) scores generations by comparing renders to targets. No 104-point head trains on the renders.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2168  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2168) 'Retracted: train a 104-point head on rendered ANNY (RFD66606-1168 moves layer segmentation into the 3D latent via rf-detr-Seg), and the wholebody-detector deployment premise. ANNY is the pose primitive throughout, propose through score.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2168  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2168) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2168  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2168) 'RFD66606-1143 (propose-score loop, published), RFD66606-1168 (layer segmentation, ideation), and RFD66606-1173 (edit-reward corpus, discussion) settled the deployment differently, so RFD66606-1122's `discussion` state stopped tracking reality.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2168  1 LINE
 Text:Written
